## 2. Go Store Model (struct)

**File:** `/bench/repo/store/memo.go` (lines 35-55)

```go
type Memo struct {
	ID        int32
	UID       string
	RowStatus RowStatus
	CreatorID int32
	CreatedTs int64
	UpdatedTs int64
	Content    string
	Visibility Visibility
	Pinned     bool
	Payload    *storepb.MemoPayload
	ParentUID *string
}
```

Companion types in the same file: `FindMemo` (lines 57-82), `FindMemoPayload` (lines 84-91), `UpdateMemo` (lines 93-103), `DeleteMemo` (lines 105-107). The `Payload` field references a protobuf-generated type `MemoPayload` from the store proto layer.

