## 3. API Proto Message

**File:** `/bench/repo/proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto` (lines 198-280)

```protobuf
message Memo {
  string name = 1;                           // resource name: memos/{memo}
  State state = 2;
  string creator = 3;                        // users/{user}
  google.protobuf.Timestamp create_time = 4;
  google.protobuf.Timestamp update_time = 5;
  string content = 7;
  Visibility visibility = 9;
  repeated string tags = 10;
  bool pinned = 11;
  repeated Attachment attachments = 12;
  repeated MemoRelation relations = 13;
  repeated Reaction reactions = 14;
  Property property = 15;
  optional string parent = 16;
  string snippet = 17;
  optional Location location = 18;

  message Property {
    bool has_link = 1;
    bool has_task_list = 2;
    bool has_code = 3;
    bool has_incomplete_tasks = 4;
    string title = 5;
  }
}
```

There is also a separate **store-layer proto** at `/bench/repo/proto/store/memo.proto` (lines 7-29) defining `MemoPayload` (with nested `Property` and `Location` messages), which is the type serialized into the `payload` JSON column.

